<%# The hub, "Pont de commandement". Desktop: the kicker, menu and daily
    booster panel on the left, the showcase in the centre, the set progress
    on the right (from 1180px; under it in the left column). Phone: one
    column without the menu, the tab bar navigating. A visitor sees the same
    menu and an invitation instead of the showcase, without the daily
    booster panel, which a player keeps once the day's booster is collected
    (the countdown to the next one). The daily claim's Turbo Stream answer
    replaces the panel, the packs chip, menu 01 and the empty showcase's
    action (bonus_arc_controller.ts flies the canister). A contributor's
    weekly goal reward shows its claim slot in the goal panel. A new
    player's first hub shows the welcome panel above the other blocks,
    after the heading in reading order.
    Never served from Turbo's cache; the packs chip's countdown refreshes it
    by morphing, keeping the scroll. The LIVE ticker fills the layout's
    ticker slot, a band along the bottom of the hub, and the public goal
    stream replaces the goal panel's public part as the periodic sum moves
    it. %>
<% turbo_exempts_page_from_cache %>
<% turbo_refreshes_with method: :morph, scroll: :preserve %>
<% content_for :ticker do %>
  <%= render "shell/ticker", items: @ticker %>
<% end %>
<div class="hub" data-controller="hub-menu" data-hub-menu-focus-first-value="<%= flash[:signed_in].present? %>">
  <header class="hub__kicker">
    <h1 id="hub-title" class="hub__title" tabindex="-1" data-hub-menu-target="heading"><%= t(".kicker.title") %></h1>
  </header>

  <%= render "pages/welcome" if @welcome %>

  <%= render "pages/menu", bank: @bank, collection: @collection, friends_online: @friends_online, achievements: @achievements %>

  <% if current_player %>
    <span hidden data-controller="bonus-arc" data-action="turbo:before-stream-render@document->bonus-arc#render"></span>
  <% end %>

  <% if current_player.nil? %>
    <%= render "pages/invitation" %>
    <%= render "pages/goal", goal: @goal %>
  <% else %>
    <%= render "pages/showcase", card: @showcase, bank: @bank %>
    <%= render "pages/goal", goal: @goal, reward: @goal_reward, bank: @bank %>
    <%= render "pages/daily_booster", bank: @bank, primary: @showcase.present? if @bank[:bonus_collectable] || @bank[:bonus_collected] %>
  <% end %>

  <%= render "pages/set_progress", sets: @sets if @sets.any? %>
</div>
<%= turbo_stream_from(*LiveStream.goal_streamables) %>
